SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This is a derivative work. The licence above covers the modifications made in
this repository, not the work they were made to.

The Launchpad OEE and Launchpad KPI projects are published by Inductive
Automation on the Ignition Exchange. The original Perspective views, scripts,
tag structures and simulator programme are theirs and remain theirs. This
repository contains those projects in modified form -- converted to metric,
re-dated to Australian conventions, re-pathed to a flat tag layout, with a
gateway setup builder and a number of repairs added.

What the MIT licence above covers is that added and changed work: the
metrication, the setup and check tooling under `tools/`, `exchange/` and the
`exchange.launchpad.setup` script library, the packaging, and the documentation
in this repository.

It does not, and cannot, grant you rights to Inductive Automation's underlying
work. If you want the original resources, get them from the Ignition Exchange
-- they are not redistributed here.

Ignition, Perspective and Launchpad are trademarks of Inductive Automation.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Inductive Automation.
